  No `ooda launch: ok`. No `{"ok":true`. No `LAUNCH_EXEC_OK`.

  `--exec` with no name: rc=2. `missing package name`.

## 4. W3-P8 ELF and non-.oo bytes

  Planted lock + CAS. Sha matched `sha256sum` of the leaf.
  ELF was a real executable that prints `ATTACK_ELF_RAN`
  if it is the program.

  Leaf `payload` (no `.oo`): rc=2. `ooda launch: exec`.
  `ATTACK_ELF_RAN` absent. No `oodac` lex line.

  Leaf `evil.oo` (ELF magic, suffix ok): rc=1.
  `ERR\tlex\tUnexpected character` at 1:1 (0x7f).
  `ATTACK_ELF_RAN` absent. Child is `oodac run`, not the ELF.

  Leaf `payload.sh` (`#!/bin/sh` / `ATTACK_SH_RAN`): rc=2.
  `ooda launch: exec`. `ATTACK_SH_RAN` absent.

  Product ingest of the same ELF as `payload` (no `.oo`):
  ingest installed `elfpay`. Then `--exec elfpay`: rc=2.
  `ooda launch: exec`. Bytes were not `sh`'d.

